{"seq":3,"slug":"cellular-memory","title":"细胞免疫与免疫记忆","url":"/l-doc-books/h/health-medicine/immunology-fundamentals/immune-response/cellular-memory","wordCount":1591,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"细胞免疫与免疫记忆\">细胞免疫与免疫记忆</h1><p>抗体进不了细胞，可病毒、胞内菌和癌变恰恰躲在细胞内部。对付这些「内鬼」，免疫系统派出 T 细胞——它不分泌可溶武器，而是亲自接触靶细胞，要么下令处决，要么调度全局。本篇接续<a href=\"humoral-response\">体液免疫应答</a>的另一半故事：T 细胞如何被激活、CD8 如何杀伤、CD4 如何指挥分化，以及所有应答收尾时如何沉淀为可终生调用的免疫记忆——这是<a href=\"../health-disease/vaccine-principles\">疫苗原理</a>最终要实现的目标。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>细胞免疫由 T 细胞主导，分两条主线：CD8<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">^+</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7713em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7713em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 细胞毒性 T 细胞（CTL）直接杀伤被感染或癌变的细胞；CD4<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">^+</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7713em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7713em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 辅助 T 细胞（Th）识别<a href=\"../molecular-recognition/mhc-antigen-presentation\">MHC 与抗原呈递</a>中 MHC II 呈递的抗原后，分化为不同亚群，分泌细胞因子调度整个免疫应答。两者激活都遵循「信号一（TCR-MHC肽）+ 信号二（共刺激）+ 信号三（细胞因子）」的三信号原则。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[树突状细胞呈递抗原] --&gt; B[CD8+ T&lt;br/&gt;识别 MHC I-肽]&#10;    A --&gt; C[CD4+ T&lt;br/&gt;识别 MHC II-肽]&#10;    B --&gt; D[细胞毒性 T 细胞 CTL]&#10;    D --&gt; E[穿孔素+颗粒酶&lt;br/&gt;诱导靶细胞凋亡]&#10;    D --&gt; F[Fas-FasL 通路杀伤]&#10;    C --&gt; G[Th1 抗胞内菌/病毒]&#10;    C --&gt; H[Th2 抗寄生虫/过敏]&#10;    C --&gt; I[Th17 抗胞外菌/真菌]&#10;    C --&gt; J[Treg 抑制·维持耐受]&#10;    C --&gt; K[Tfh 辅助 B 细胞]&#10;    E --&gt; L[应答收尾→记忆 T 细胞]&#10;    G --&gt; L\">flowchart TD\n    A[树突状细胞呈递抗原] --&gt; B[CD8+ T&lt;br/&gt;识别 MHC I-肽]\n    A --&gt; C[CD4+ T&lt;br/&gt;识别 MHC II-肽]\n    B --&gt; D[细胞毒性 T 细胞 CTL]\n    D --&gt; E[穿孔素+颗粒酶&lt;br/&gt;诱导靶细胞凋亡]\n    D --&gt; F[Fas-FasL 通路杀伤]\n    C --&gt; G[Th1 抗胞内菌/病毒]\n    C --&gt; H[Th2 抗寄生虫/过敏]\n    C --&gt; I[Th17 抗胞外菌/真菌]\n    C --&gt; J[Treg 抑制·维持耐受]\n    C --&gt; K[Tfh 辅助 B 细胞]\n    E --&gt; L[应答收尾→记忆 T 细胞]\n    G --&gt; L</pre><p>下表概括 CD4<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">^+</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7713em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7713em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> T 细胞的主要亚群分化，这是细胞免疫「指挥系统」的核心：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>亚群</th>\n<th>关键细胞因子</th>\n<th>主要功能</th>\n<th>失调相关</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Th1</td>\n<td>IFN-<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>γ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\gamma</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">γ</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>激活巨噬细胞，抗胞内病原</td>\n<td>某些自身免疫病</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Th2</td>\n<td>IL-4/5/13</td>\n<td>抗寄生虫，驱动 IgE</td>\n<td>过敏与哮喘</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Th17</td>\n<td>IL-17</td>\n<td>抗胞外菌与真菌</td>\n<td>银屑病、克罗恩病</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Treg</td>\n<td>IL-10/TGF-<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>β</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\beta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>抑制免疫，维持自我耐受</td>\n<td>缺陷→自身免疫</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Tfh</td>\n<td>IL-21</td>\n<td>在生发中心辅助 B 细胞</td>\n<td>影响抗体质量</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"cd8-细胞毒性-t-细胞-精准处决\">CD8 细胞毒性 T 细胞：精准处决</h2><p>CTL 是免疫系统的「狙击手」。当它的 TCR 识别到靶细胞 MHC I 上呈递的异常肽（病毒蛋白或肿瘤突变肽），便与靶细胞形成紧密的免疫突触，然后启动定向杀伤——而且只杀这一个接触到的细胞，邻近健康细胞毫发无损，这种精准度对避免组织损伤至关重要。</p>\n<p>杀伤有两条途径。主途径是分泌穿孔素和颗粒酶：穿孔素在靶细胞膜上形成通道，颗粒酶（一种丝氨酸蛋白酶）经此进入，激活 caspase 级联，诱导靶细胞凋亡（程序性死亡，而非炸裂式坏死，避免病毒扩散）。次途径是 Fas-FasL：CTL 表面的 FasL 结合靶细胞的 Fas 受体，同样触发凋亡。杀完一个，CTL 可「连续作战」转向下一个靶细胞。CTL 的有效启动高度依赖<a href=\"../overview/organs-cells\">免疫器官与细胞</a>中树突状细胞的交叉呈递，这也是肿瘤免疫的关键瓶颈。</p>\n<h2 id=\"cd4-辅助-t-细胞-免疫的指挥中枢\">CD4 辅助 T 细胞：免疫的指挥中枢</h2><p>如果说 CTL 是士兵，CD4<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">^+</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7713em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7713em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> T 细胞就是参谋部。初始 CD4<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">^+</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7713em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7713em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> T 细胞被激活后，会根据所处的细胞因子环境分化为不同亚群，决定整场免疫应答的「打法」。这是免疫系统因敌制宜的关键：面对胞内病毒/细菌，分化出 Th1，分泌 IFN-<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>γ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\gamma</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">γ</span></span></span></span></span> 强力激活巨噬细胞和 CTL；面对寄生虫，分化出 Th2，驱动 IgE 和嗜酸性粒细胞；面对胞外细菌与真菌，分化出 Th17 招募中性粒细胞。</p>\n<p>其中两个亚群尤其重要。Tfh 是连接细胞与体液免疫的桥梁，专门在生发中心辅助 B 细胞完成<a href=\"humoral-response\">体液免疫应答</a>的亲和力成熟。调节性 T 细胞（Treg）则是「刹车」——它分泌抑制性细胞因子（IL-10、TGF-<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>β</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\beta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span></span></span></span></span>）压制过度免疫，是外周自我耐受的核心。Treg 功能缺陷会引发严重自身免疫，而肿瘤又常招募 Treg 来逃避免疫，这两条线索分别延伸到<a href=\"../health-disease/allergy-autoimmunity\">过敏与自身免疫</a>和<a href=\"../health-disease/tumor-immunotherapy\">肿瘤免疫与免疫疗法</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"应答的收尾-收缩期与稳态\">应答的收尾：收缩期与稳态</h2><p>任何强烈的免疫应答都不能无限持续，否则会耗竭机体、损伤组织。病原被清除后，应答进入收缩期（contraction）：约 90%–95% 的效应 T 细胞在数周内通过凋亡被清除，免疫系统回归稳态。这个「该停就停」的能力与「该打就打」同等重要——收缩失败正是慢性炎症与免疫病理的根源之一。</p>\n<p>存活下来的那 5%–10% 不是随机的，而是被选择保留下来、转化为记忆 T 细胞的精英克隆。它们经历过实战，数量比初始克隆多得多，且激活阈值更低、反应更快。可以把效应细胞数量随时间的变化粗略描述为先指数扩增、达峰、再指数收缩到一个记忆平台 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>N</mi><mtext>mem</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N_{\\text{mem}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">mem</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 的曲线。</p>\n<h2 id=\"免疫记忆-终生防护的细胞基础\">免疫记忆：终生防护的细胞基础</h2><p>免疫记忆是整个适应性免疫最有价值的产物，也是本章和上一章共同收束的终点。记忆细胞分为几类，分工互补：中央记忆 T 细胞（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>C</mi><mi>M</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{CM}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>）驻留淋巴器官，增殖潜力强，是「战略储备」；效应记忆 T 细胞（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>E</mi><mi>M</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{EM}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>）巡逻外周组织，能立即发挥效应；组织驻留记忆 T 细胞（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>R</mi><mi>M</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{RM}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>）则常驻于皮肤、肺、肠等曾经感染的部位，构成「就地防御」的前哨——这是近年研究热点，对黏膜疫苗设计意义重大。</p>\n<p>记忆的存在解释了三件事：为什么麻疹、水痘等病通常只得一次；为什么<a href=\"../health-disease/vaccine-principles\">疫苗原理</a>能用无害抗原换来长期保护；以及为什么二次应答比初次快得多、强得多。结合<a href=\"humoral-response\">体液免疫应答</a>的记忆 B 细胞和长寿浆细胞，T 与 B 两套记忆共同构成了人体对抗反复感染的「免疫档案」，这正是<a href=\"../overview/adaptive-immunity\">适应性免疫</a>四大特征中记忆性的细胞学落地。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>细胞免疫对付胞内威胁：CD8<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">^+</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7713em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7713em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> CTL 直接杀伤，CD4<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">^+</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7713em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7713em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> Th 分化为多亚群指挥全局。</li>\n<li>T 细胞激活遵循三信号原则（TCR-MHC肽、共刺激、细胞因子），CTL 启动依赖 DC 交叉呈递。</li>\n<li>CTL 通过穿孔素-颗粒酶和 Fas-FasL 诱导靶细胞凋亡，精准且可连续作战。</li>\n<li>CD4 亚群因敌制宜（Th1/Th2/Th17），Tfh 桥接体液免疫，Treg 维持外周耐受。</li>\n<li>应答收尾期清除约 90% 效应细胞，保留精英为记忆 T 细胞（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>C</mi><mi>M</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{CM}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>/<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>E</mi><mi>M</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{EM}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>/<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>R</mi><mi>M</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{RM}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>）。</li>\n<li>T 与 B 记忆共同构成免疫档案，是终生防护与疫苗的细胞学基础。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"细胞免疫与免疫记忆","id":"细胞免疫与免疫记忆"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"CD8 细胞毒性 T 细胞：精准处决","id":"cd8-细胞毒性-t-细胞-精准处决"},{"level":2,"text":"CD4 辅助 T 细胞：免疫的指挥中枢","id":"cd4-辅助-t-细胞-免疫的指挥中枢"},{"level":2,"text":"应答的收尾：收缩期与稳态","id":"应答的收尾-收缩期与稳态"},{"level":2,"text":"免疫记忆：终生防护的细胞基础","id":"免疫记忆-终生防护的细胞基础"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"体液免疫应答","url":"/l-doc-books/h/health-medicine/immunology-fundamentals/immune-response/humoral-response"},"next":{"title":"疫苗原理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/health-medicine/immunology-fundamentals/health-disease/vaccine-principles"}}